url: "https://pypi.org/project/prism-risk/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - liquid hydrogen
  - quantitative risk assessment
  - digital twin
  - consequence modeling
abstract: >-
  Research framework connecting generic LH2 facility contracts, literature-based
  initiating frequencies, isolated source-pinned physical models, known leak
  telemetry and conditional human-harm evaluation. Numerical diagnostic chain
  implementation is distinguished from complete facility QRA, independent physical
  validation and fresh-physics real-time performance, which remain incomplete or
  unverified. The project-authored standard QRA implementation is bundled;
  optional equipment and consequence providers retain their own licenses.
